# Lordicon Icon Standard

- Use animated icons from `https://lordicon.com/` only.
- Use JSON Lottie via the `<lord-icon>` web component and local wrappers in `apps/web/src/components/lordicon/`.
- Prefer **System / Solid** icons and choose icons that clearly match button intent (e.g. settings cog for settings, pencil for edit, trash for delete).
- Do not reintroduce Animate UI icon components or `@animate-ui` registries.
- For new icon usage in React pages/components, import from `apps/web/src/components/lordicon/icons.tsx`.
- Keep icon behavior consistent with existing button hover animation patterns.
